<!--Post: 3264--><!--Time: 1104704845-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3264"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 2:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The first map shows some of the Wichita public transit routes in relationship to the murders and other locations of interest. <BR> <BR>My original &#40;not current&#41; theory was that BTK lived close to the central transit terminal and OldTown.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
