<!--Post: 4372--><!--Time: 1106259388-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4372"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 20, 2005 - 2:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here is an updated map <BR> <BR><a href="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/NewMap.jpg" target=_top>http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/NewMa p.jpg</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4372-->
<!--Post: 4380--><!--Time: 1106272126-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4380"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Curious2<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Curious2<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 20, 2005 - 5:48 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks, Analyzer - what a great view!  I&#39;m  <BR>from Texas and have never been to Wichita, <BR>so I&#39;m wondering whether Freeway 54 is the <BR>same as Freeway 400 on my Mapquest map?? <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4380-->
<!--Post: 4381--><!--Time: 1106273282-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4381"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Curious2<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Curious2<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 20, 2005 - 6:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Also, Analyzer - what about Kellogg Drive?? <BR>It&#39;s all so confusing to me - it appears to <BR>be the same as 400 and 54, also!  HELP!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4381-->
<!--Post: 4383--><!--Time: 1106274728-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4383"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 20, 2005 - 6:32 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Curious2 <BR> <BR>According to my maps they are all the same. By this I mean that 400 and 54 show up opposite the same freeway and the Freeway ends up dying out and becoming Kellogg Drive.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
